+    *   **Triangle Normal:** Compute normal $n = e_1 \times e_2$. Project triangle vertices and box onto $n$. Separation if $Dot(n, vmin) + d > 0$ where $d = -Dot(n, v_1)$ [S2, unofficial].
 
